rom '@substrate-system/emoji-input'\n\ndocument.body += `\n    <div class=\"example\">\n        <${EmojiInput.TAG}>\n            <textarea></textarea>\n        </${EmojiInput.TAG}>\n    </div>\n`\n```\n\n### Emoji Picker Component\n\nAn emoji picker UI. This package inlcudes a convenient button\ncomponent for openening the picker.\n\n```ts\nimport { EmojiPicker } from '@substrate-system/emoji-input/picker'","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
